    Bug 1949810 - Fix in-app notification button alignment with some scripts. r=aleca,arschmitz

    Make the non-donation layout the default instead of trying to revert/work with donation specific
    layout choices.
    While here, this also adds some custom element specific jsdocs to the in-app notification
    components and updates the container story to support changing the type.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D246283

